    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world of wonder and magic, an epic adventure awaits!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist meets a tragic end, struck by a truck, only to be reborn into an isekai. Guided by a Goddess, they embark on a journey to become a Mage Adventurer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover treasures in chests, obtain powerful equipment, and grow stronger.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Battle monsters, level up, and evolve into a legendary hero.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Take on challenging quests from the Adventurer's Guild.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique roguelike elements: choose one of three enhancement scrolls\u2014every decision shapes your destiny.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize your path with a meticulously designed Skill Tree system.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With pixel art visuals and a blend of adventure, RPG, and light roguelike mechanics, experience a Metroidvania-style world. Follow the protagonist's journey to overcome trials, defeat the Demon King, and forge your own legend!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this adventure and start your isekai journey today!  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world of wonder and magic, an epic adventure awaits!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist meets a tragic end, struck by a truck, only to be reborn into an isekai. Guided by a Goddess, they embark on a journey to become a Mage Adventurer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover treasures in chests, obtain powerful equipment, and grow stronger.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Battle monsters, level up, and evolve into a legendary hero.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Take on challenging quests from the Adventurer's Guild.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique roguelike elements: choose one of three enhancement scrolls\u2014every decision shapes your destiny.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize your path with a meticulously designed Skill Tree system.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With pixel art visuals and a blend of adventure, RPG, and light roguelike mechanics, experience a Metroidvania-style world. Follow the protagonist's journey to overcome trials, defeat the Demon King, and forge your own legend!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this adventure and start your isekai journey today!  </p>",
    "short_description": "Protagonist dies in a truck accident, reborn as a Mage Adventurer in an isekai. Explore chests, battle monsters, complete quests, and customize skills via roguelike mechanics. Defeat the Demon King in this blend of RPG, adventure, and light roguelike.",
